Black Spirit Life map-core source-code license status
=====================================================

The repository root `LICENSE` controls the original Black Spirit Life source
code in this package. No permission is granted by this package notice beyond
that root source-code license.

Third-party and fan-content material is not relicensed by this notice:

- The transformed SomethingLovely source is provided under its upstream MIT
  license. The complete notice is included at
  `assets/licenses/SOMETHINGLOVELY-MIT.txt`.
- Black Desert names, facts, imagery, and other game content remain Pearl
  Abyss material and are used under the project's recorded unofficial,
  noncommercial fan-content basis.
- Workerman/Shrddr tiles, node icons, lodging inputs, and economics inputs are
  retained with attribution under the project owner's recorded community-use
  decision. No separate written license from Shrddr is claimed.
- BDO Codex and BDOLytics are credited research and retrieval references for
  Pearl Abyss-origin facts and game assets; no site-authored prose, page design,
  guide commentary, or annotations are retained.

See the repository root `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and `ASSET_SOURCES.md` for the
complete credits, source links, notices, and correction/removal route.
